Z||000000||TRL46202||12-15-1999||08:59 PM||||What is the cloth like thing on the egr tube? It looks very old and worn, does this cloth have to be on it? but the car runs great! 150,000 miles.....||||reg||1
Z||000001||HF6582||12-15-1999||09:03 PM||||it's a heat shield material.<P><BR>Scott||||reg||1
Z||000002||Bruce||12-15-1999||11:35 PM||||You can buy replacement material- it's expensive, though. I replaced mine, but had a mechanic do it. Surprisingly, though, the material stays fairly intact even though it looks crappy.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Carrolles||12-16-1999||07:19 AM||||The replacement EGR tubes from IRM and FOCOA don't have the insulating blanket.  I've had one installed for two years now with no problems.  Just be sure that none of the vacuum tubes are too close to the tube.||||reg||1
